      "type": "p",
      "text": "**Short answer:** use **RAG (retrieval-augmented generation)** when the model needs **knowledge** it doesn't have, such as your policies, tickets or product data, especially when that knowledge changes or answers need citations. Use **fine-tuning** when the model needs a **behaviour** it doesn't do reliably, such as a fixed output format, a domain style or a narrow classification task. Many production systems combine good prompting, RAG for knowledge and, occasionally, a small fine-tune for behaviour."
